## Project Structure

```
smart-dialer/
├── app.py                          # Streamlit simulator UI
├── requirements.txt
├── smartdialer/
│   ├── models.py                   # Agent / Borrower / Call + their states
│   ├── agent_manager.py            # In-memory agent pool + lifecycle
│   ├── agent_lifecycle.py          # Shared agent state-transition rules
│   ├── borrower_manager.py         # In-memory borrower pool
│   ├── call_manager.py             # Call state machine
│   ├── call_allocator.py           # Pairs borrowers with agents
│   ├── pacing_engine.py            # Progressive pacing
│   ├── predictive_pacing_engine.py # Predictive pacing
│   ├── safety_controller.py        # The single gatekeeper
│   ├── progressive_dialer.py       # Progressive orchestrator
│   ├── predictive_dialer.py        # Predictive orchestrator
│   ├── provider.py                 # Provider interface
│   ├── provider_a.py               # Mock provider A
│   ├── provider_b.py               # Mock provider B
│   ├── event_processor.py          # Applies one event to a call
│   └── persistent_store.py         # Cross-process storage + crash recovery
└── tests/                          # 98 tests across every module above
```

